WEBVTT

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.380
"EPISODE 8:
CANCER CELL II (PART II)"

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:47.000
"EPISODE 8:
CANCER CELL II (PART II)"
"Cancer Cell II (Part II)."

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.880
All right, how should we go about this?

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.710
Where should the first slash go?

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:55.080
Harmful bacteria.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:59.500
Pathogenic E. coli, Staphylococci,
Clostridium and the like

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.790
cause proteins to degrade
and produce toxic by-products.

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:07.120
They are detrimental to the
human body in various ways.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:13.120
Impressive! You harmful bacteria
are the entertainers of evil!

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:17.170
Incredible! Letting him know
what you're about to do to him...

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.120
How insanely cruel!

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:23.580
How about slamming him against
the wall with your tentacles next?

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.000
Opportunistic pathogens.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.170
Bacteroides, non-pathogenic E. coli,
Eubacterium and the like

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:33.170
are all bacteria which do
neither good nor harm.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:37.830
They make up roughly 70 percent
of the bacteria in the intestines.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.420
Shut up, opportunistic pathogens!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:46.250
I'm trying to come up with the most artistic
way of tormenting this cell in the name of evil!

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.000
So, don't disturb me!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.710
So brutal! I'm getting goosebumps!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:54.250
Well, not that I can blame you
opportunistic bacteria

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:59.500
for being enthralled by our cool evil souls.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:00.580
Watch and learn!

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.460
--Woo-hoo!
--Hey there, Mr. President!

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.000
You're so cool!

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.960
All right, what should I do?

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.040
Should I start dismembering you
from the fingertips?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.830
Okay, I've got it.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.460
Your eyes!

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.330
"WHITE BLOOD CELL"

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:22.960
Damn!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:26.420
White Blood Cells!

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.880
Sorry to keep you waiting, Cell boy!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:35.420
You've got a lot of nerve, rampaging around
the biggest immune system in the body!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.960
It's punishment time, you lousy germs!

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.790
Gut immunity.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:45.080
The ability to fight off and eliminate
bacteria and viruses invading the body

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.670
is called "immunity."

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:50.120
The digestive tract acts as a barrier
to protect against infection

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:56.080
and is said to be home to upward of 50 percent
of the body's immune system.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.920
Wh-What should we do, Harmful Bacterium?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.080
Hold your ground! So unsightly!

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.000
Huh! We've still got...

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.290
...the edge in sheer numbers!

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.330
What the... Where'd all these come from?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:13.880
This staggering number of opportunistic
bacteria are all my allies!

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.750
In an environment where
the harmful bacteria hold sway...

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.620
...you should be mortified that you were ever
rash enough to show your idiotic faces

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.500
even for a second!

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.460
Numbers! The symbol of power!

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:29.040
There is no higher aesthetic for
us bacteria than to win by numbers!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.790
"THUNK"
"POP POP"
"RUMBLE RUMBLE"
Nyuuu!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.120
A-Are those good bacteria?

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.580
Good bacteria.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:03.000
Lactic acid bacterium, Lactobacillus gasseri,
Lactobacillus bifidus and the like

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:08.040
work to boost immunity
and to stimulate intestinal activity.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.790
Their actions are beneficial
for the human body's health.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:26.880
Nyuuu!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:30.210
How can there be so much good bacteria?

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:32.000
Hey, opportunistic bacteria!

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.540
What are you doing?
Get rid of them already--

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.420
"TRAMPLE"
"TRAMPLE"

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.120
"CRUSH"
"CRUSH"
Huh?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.670
Quit nagging, will you?
The environment's changed, all right?

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.420
Right! What do you mean
by "artistic" and "cool evil"?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:47.250
Don't be full of yourselves! How troublesome!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.710
From now on, it will be
the Age of Good Bacteria!

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:54.290
It's time for us to find our place
among the beautiful and wholesome bacteria!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.330
The nature of opportunistic pathogens.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:00.960
They ally themselves with whichever bacteria,
good or harmful, has the upper hand.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.170
So... So anyway...

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:03.500
"FLIP-FLOP"
So... So anyway...

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.880
"FLIP-FLOP"
...let's all get along and be friends, everyone!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.830
"FLIP-FLOP"
Not by a long shot.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:13.380
All you germs guilty of unlawful entry,
get the cell out!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.880
"PLATELETS"

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:25.880
We should feel a little safer here, huh?

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:27.830
Oh look, Big Sister!

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:28.960
Huh?

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.210
Wait, something's changed?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.080
It's easier to breathe!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.540
Yeah!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.290
Come to think of it...

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:47.920
This is toxic gas from the harmful bacteria
that live in the intestines.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:54.290
The bacterial balance in the gut must be off,
and the harmful bacteria seem to be predominant.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:54.540
"CELL"
The bacterial balance in the gut must be off,
and the harmful bacteria seem to be predominant.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.500
"CELL"
This is bound to cause some harmful effects.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.420
This is bound to cause some harmful effects.

00:06:57.420 --> 00:07:01.620
I wonder if White Blood Cell is all right.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.290
Memory T! NK!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.040
Don't worry.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:10.000
I'm not planning to kill them.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.120
There!

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:14.460
Stop!

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:17.040
Knock it off!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.420
Cancer Cell!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:24.080
Why? Why won't you fight me? Fight me!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.710
I don't want to.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.500
Because what I like about you
is how self-contradictory you are.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:32.580
You're the same as me,
writhing within your preordained destiny.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.330
I don't want to kill a friend.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:39.420
That's right. Unlike you...

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.170
...I detest you!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.880
Because you called me "a goddamn bug"!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.540
Stop! Isn't that enough?

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.750
Step away from Memory T!

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:58.290
I can't tell you how glad I am that
I brought the three of you here.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.290
I like you, White Blood Cell!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.790
I could sit and chat with you
about all kinds of things.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.750
As for Memory T and NK, I hate you both!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.000
What wouldn't I give to demolish
everything you hold dear?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.170
I can turn those emotions into energy

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:15.330
and acquire that power
way sooner than I thought!

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.670
If I divide once, it'll be double.

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:20.580
Divide again, and I can double again!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:25.000
A mere thirty divisions will result...

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.580
...in more than a billion of my friends.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.330
Try and stop me if you can...

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:36.250
...my hard-working Immune Cells.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.460
It's too soon for a victory lap.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:44.790
I still have my...

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.620
...trump card left.

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:52.330
Bursting at the seams with my memories...

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.620
The ultimate secret technique!

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:56.080
Memory T?

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:59.210
That moron... What in the world is he...

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:01.250
And it's called...

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:09.460
The T Cell Ultimate Secret Technique...
"Perforin Cannon Punch"!

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:15.580
"T Cell Per--" What?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.380
Huh?

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.880
"T..." Huh?

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.170
What was that?

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:24.250
"T Cell Puerile Cretin Panties"?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.170
That's "T Cell Perforin Cannon Punch"!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.040
Secret technique?

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.620
The thymus.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:37.330
The lymphoid organ where
Precursor T Cells are differentiated

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:40.170
and then mature into full-fledged T Cells.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:55.080
Hey, you were hopeless a little while ago,
but these days you're on fire!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.580
That was just dumb luck.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:10:00.620
But I'm going to keep grinding away
and hone my skills. You'll see.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.210
Actually, the way you're going...
Oh, but I shouldn't say it...

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.790
Oh come on, spit it out!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.620
Well... See... I'm thinking
that a cell of your caliber

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.830
just might be able to master
that ultimate secret technique.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.000
Ultimate secret technique?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:19.040
Yeah. It's called the "T Cell Ultimate
Secret Technique"...

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:23.040
Perforin... Cannon Punch!

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.120
Perforin.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:30.620
A chemical released by Killer T Cells
upon attacking infected cells.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.830
It's a legendary move
that can only be unleashed

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:39.170
when a T Cell's urge to protect the world
intensifies to its maximum peak inside him.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:42.580
They say that whoever's on the receiving end
of its devastating force and impact

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:47.210
ends up getting blasted away
like they were smashed with a massive fist.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.960
"Ultimate Secret Technique"...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.710
Emotions... Making your fist... Massive...

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.960
The T Cell Ultimate Secret Technique...

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.330
Perf... Perforin Cannon Punch!

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.420
Whoops, I mangled it.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.500
Oh jeez, he's really practicing it!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.170
Who would've thought he'd swallow
a dumbass story like that?

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.670
Like that kind of move even exists!

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:12.000
Perforin C-Cannon Panty!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.670
Oh crap, my arm cramped up!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.040
What are those guys doing?

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:21.670
They just want to reassure themselves by looking
down on others. What a pair of morons.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:49.330
You're not going to get your way.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.000
Oh?

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.380
Eat this!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:59.330
T Cell...

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:04.250
...Perforin Cannon Punch!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:18.790
T Cell Perforin Cannon Punch!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.540
It really...

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.120
...worked!

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:51.790
Wh-Wh-What the cell was
that baffling move just now?

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:55.000
Regulatory... Regulatory T Cell!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.210
You're supposed to suppress his attacks!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.250
Why did you just dodge now?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.250
It's your job to protect me--

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.120
I should've known better.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:06.330
I seem to have misperceived you.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.330
Huh?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.710
You are not a cell that warrants protection.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:16.710
Now, at last, I've realized my error.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:22.210
Upon closer inspection, I can see...

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.040
...that you're not a cell...

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.540
"CLL"
...but rather a "cll."

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.670
"CLL"
That's what convinced you?

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:31.460
Regulatory T Cell's role.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:34.040
Once she's perceived a change in a Cancer Cell,

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:39.580
Regulatory T Cell no longer recognizes
it as a cell to be protected.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:43.000
Because I'm a "cll," not a "cell"?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.460
Is that it?

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.710
That's correct.

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:49.460
And I'm not a cell that
warrants protection, huh?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:53.540
So, that means you're no longer
on my side, right?

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.750
Well, I guess that's fine by me.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:00.500
If that's what you think, Regulatory T Cell,
then that's fine by me.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.080
But...

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.960
...you're going to have to stay out of my way!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:08.540
I told you! I know all your tricks!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:09.920
"CLENCH"
Nailed it!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.040
And I told you, remember?

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.250
Slashing me does no good!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.830
Stop making me repeat myself!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.790
I'm telling you, I know all your tricks!
Didn't you hear--

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:32.540
What's wrong? I thought you knew all my tricks!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.750
Whoa! Whoa!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:45.250
All right, let's finish this now, Immune Cells.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.460
Damn!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.750
I'll kill you!

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.420
Damn!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.670
Crap! Damn, you're hard!

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:22.710
Won't be long now.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:25.210
This is...

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.380
...the end!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:52.500
The new world...

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.040
Now we can be free!

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.920
And...

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:01.540
It's over now.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.540
The only thing that's over is you!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.790
--You goddamn bug!
--You miserable Cancer Cell!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:16.420
--Die!
--Die!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:24.380
I'm telling you, you can slash me,
you can stab me, and I won't die.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.710
My wings! Wh-Why?

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:37.670
I can't maintain my strength!

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:41.080
I'm no longer getting a boost?

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.790
But why?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.620
It looks like the intestinal
environment's changed,

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:54.040
so now the toxins from the harmful bacteria
that were empowering you are dwindling.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.790
White Blood Cell--

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:17.380
I've been defeated.

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:21.540
So, I lose again, huh?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.710
Oh well, that's fine.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:33.540
I'd rather be killed by a friend
than by someone I hate. This is way better.

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:38.790
See you... my gentle assassin... White...

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.120
...Blood... Cell...

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.620
All right, it's over!

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.710
You guys...

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:59.920
You've gotten so big!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:03.670
Nyuuu!

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:06.620
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.120
Lactic acid bacteria.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.170
Good bacteria that work to support
the health of the human body.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.960
They have a variety of features.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.170
Nyuuu?

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.830
I'm okay.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.580
Nyuuu!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.750
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.580
Thank goodness, Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.920
Nyuuu!

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.830
Hey, thanks for coming to save me!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.710
Nyuuu?

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.580
Nyuuu!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:40.620
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:46.210
The Cancer Cell has been vanquished!

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:48.380
The crisis is over!

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.960
"IT REALLY WORKED..."
It really worked.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.210
"YES, IT DID."
"IT REALLY WORKED..."
Yes, it did.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.380
Nyuuu!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:57.750
Whoa! Amazing!

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.620
Just look at him repair
the intestinal wall for us!

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.420
Nyuuu!

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.580
How lactic acid bacteria works.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:09.290
Some lactic acid bacteria directly stimulate
the Intestinal Epithelial Cells

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:13.620
to help maintain the intestinal
tract's barrier functions.

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.210
Lactic Acid Bacterium, you're awesome!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.580
Thanks to you guys,
the intestinal environment's improving!

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.830
Nyuuu!

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.620
You did great, too, Cell boy!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.580
Huh? Me?

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:29.000
Bringing those lactic acid bacteria
back to their friends

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.920
helped to improve the intestinal environment.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:35.120
It was you who rescued us. Thanks.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:41.580
Jeez. Just once in my life,
if someone would say...

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.540
..."Thank you for rescuing me!"

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.620
What wouldn't I give to hear those words?

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.620
You mean I...

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.000
I was able to help out, too?

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.120
Yeah!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.380
Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.790
Intestinal environment and immunity.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:04.120
Three different types of bacteria reside in
the intestines. Good, harmful and opportunistic.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:08.040
The intestinal environment changes whenever
there is a shift in the balance between them.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:12.040
When the number of good bacteria increases,
there's a boost in immunity.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:14.920
Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:22.790
Intestinal flora.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:28.250
There are good, harmful and opportunistic
bacteria residing in the intestinal tract,

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:33.580
comprising hundreds of billions of bacteria
from hundreds of different species.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:40.710
Because it looks like a flower bed of colonies
of various plants in the intestinal tract,

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.790
it's called "intestinal flora."

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.080
So, this...

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:50.460
This is the world where you guys live, huh?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.500
